enge / The Problem -->\r\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"case-section\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"section-number\">02</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\">Client & Challenge</h2>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-content\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tThis project was developed under a university innovation initiative\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tdesigned to test digital entrepreneurship viability using minimal\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tcapital and AI automation. The target market—university\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstudents—demonstrated strong demand for premium fragrances but were\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tconstrained by limited budgets and lack of localized availability.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tExisting luxury brands were either overpriced or not effectively\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tmarketed to student demographics, creating an underserved niche\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\topportunity\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"info-grid\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"info-item\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"info-label\">Industry</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"info-value\">E-commerce / Beauty & Lifestyle</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"info-item\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"info-label\">Market</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"info-value\">University Student Segment</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"info-item\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"info-label\">Pain Point</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"info-value\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDesire for luxury at affordable prices\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"info-item\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"info-label\">Opportunity</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"info-value\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHigh-margin resale & AI-powered scaling\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<!-- 03 - Our Approach / Solution -->\r\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"case-section\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"section-number\">03</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-t